# The README makes claims that are checked by the test suite, and the tests need
# the eval sets, the regenerating scripts and the committed artefacts to check
# them. setuptools' default templates ship tests/test*.py but none of those, so a
# source install got a suite that failed on import-time file lookups. Ship the
# three directories the tests read.
include README.md CHANGELOG.md LICENSE
recursive-include src/quant_regress *.py
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include scripts *.py
recursive-include evals *.jsonl
recursive-include results *.json
